ェント家出身の女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エリスの従者だが、主人に対する言動や行動は軽く、一見すると仲の良い幼なじみに思えるほど。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“今ドキの女子学生”と周囲に認識させるために口調や言動を演じており、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"麻保志学園に入学してからは一度もそのベールを脱いだことは無い模様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"宗一郎曰く、雫を一言で言い表すと “あざとさの化身” とのこと。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あ、もしかしてもしかして…… 櫻井センパイってロリコンだったりします？　きゃー、犯されるー」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"50302"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"学年","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"50302","value":"後期課程"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7c3f37f13d0b221cb56e12e13338a4ea1318fe3746f37452f677379581a4bde3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a0/a012b1431d18e18462eb18e384fd791b048f6b6d4139055a9c45eea08fa131f3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"くすはら ゆい","creatorId":"vndb:s985","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s985","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s985","name":"石原 舞","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:77086","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p5457","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:4644","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p5457","name":"Campus","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:26505:4644","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p22648","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p22648","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p22648","name":"香子兰翻译同好会","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:154653:v22618","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p5457","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p5457","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p5457","name":"Campus","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:63071:v22618","source":"vndb"}],"missingStates":["current-runtime-cover-unavailable"],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
